       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. D13M.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-OUT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           CALL "D13S" USING BY REFERENCE WS-OUT.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL1 OUT=" WS-OUT.
           CALL "D13S" USING BY REFERENCE WS-OUT.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL2 OUT=" WS-OUT.
           CALL "D13S" USING BY REFERENCE WS-OUT.
           DISPLAY "AFTER CALL3 OUT=" WS-OUT.
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. D13S.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT BAD-FILE ASSIGN TO "D13NOSUCH.DAT"
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS FS-BAD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  BAD-FILE.
       01  BAD-REC PIC X(10).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FS-BAD PIC XX.
       01  WS-CALLS PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-OUT PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-OUT.
       DECLARATIVES.
       BAD-HANDLER SECTION.
           USE AFTER STANDARD ERROR PROCEDURE ON BAD-FILE.
       BAD-HANDLER-PARA.
           DISPLAY "SUB HANDLER FIRED FS=" FS-BAD.
       END DECLARATIVES.
       SUB-MAIN SECTION.
       SUB-MAIN-PARA.
           ADD 1 TO WS-CALLS.
           OPEN INPUT BAD-FILE.
           MOVE WS-CALLS TO LK-OUT.
           DISPLAY "SUB CALL NUMBER=" WS-CALLS.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM D13S.
       END PROGRAM D13M.
